      "content": "hey, im a bit confused about some stuff happening at my kid's elementary school. they're starting to use these new lessons about gender identity in class. i've heard different things from other parents and the school staff, so i was wondering if you could help me understand the different viewpoints on this? like, what are people actually arguing about?",
